## FreeRTOS Architecture

The firmware is divided into independent FreeRTOS tasks:

| Task | Function |
|---|---|
| `defaultTask` | Default system task |
| `CurrentTask` | ACS712 current acquisition |
| `IMUTask` | MPU-6500 vibration acquisition |
| `DHTTask` | Temperature/humidity acquisition |
| `MotorTask` | PWM and motor protection control |
| `CommunicationTask` | UART communication |
| `ProcessingTask` | Sensor threshold evaluation and health classification |

The ProcessingTask has the highest priority because it is responsible for
evaluating the motor health state and initiating motor shutdown when a
critical condition is detected.
